riria-kernel

currently the kernel boots up and prints some stuff, not that interesting.

things that work:
- gdt/idt/irq/isr - gdt is fucky but it does the job for now
- syscall - currently only write(4) which writes to stdout
- elf execution -stupidly basic but it works

things that doesnt work:
- pmm
- vmm + paging
- malloc and family

credits:
i would like to credit to these projects for making this possible in the first place
- https://github.com/klange/toaru-nih | most of internal are based off toaru-nih (not the main ToaruOS).

